  "body": "Please add target=\"_hidden\" or target=\"_temp\" or target=\"_autoclose\" to make possible to invoke a page that will be closed without additional scripts after getting headers or after full DOM structure loading. \r\n\r\nReason: I want to show with meta tag using :target and #hashTag dialog, that the session is near to end and after clicking a link the session will be prolonged without reloading the site and possible loss of form data.\r\n\r\nAny other solution: new value for meta refresh tag which allow to close site after timeout.  ",
